{"time": 1753549321, "type": "reply", "message_id": "590770636", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[浅上绘梨花]进行技能[聆听:60]检定: 1D100=10 极难成功，流水落花春去也，天上人间"}
{"time": 1753549354, "type": "recv", "message_id": "832106891", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（你竟然没有一次失败）"}
{"time": 1753549363, "type": "recv", "message_id": "988694250", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"推了一番发现锁得很严实，绕着铁门附近转转"}
{"time": 1753549366, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1255201682", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(新手保护期)"}
{"time": 1753549473, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2107443016", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "少女发现，刚才离开山下的教学楼时能听到的夏日蝉鸣和鸟叫声，此时已经消失不见，耳边仅仅留下风拂过树叶的声音，和自己踩在砂石地上的沙沙声。"}
{"time": 1753549498, "type": "recv", "message_id": "741550569", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "突然，校舍后似乎传来了一声轻微的关门声。"}
{"time": 1753549530, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1460468854", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（我超，我看这描述我都有点怕，你这个人物是真勇啊）"}
{"time": 1753549539, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1629937924", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（我到这我估计我就跑了）"}
{"time": 1753549543, "type": "recv", "message_id": "227698992", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(不信邪的巫女是这样的)"}
{"time": 1753549579, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1569750128", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"从包里拿出御币，把御盐洒在门口。紧接着朝着发出声音的校舍后走过去"}
{"time": 1753549698, "type": "recv", "message_id": "852687495", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "校舍后还有一个较小的铁门，锈蚀痕迹并没有那么严重。"}
{"time": 1753549716, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1347523360", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "这似乎是旧校舍的后门。"}
{"time": 1753549734, "type": "recv", "message_id": "766194155", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"刚刚听到的就是这里没错吧？\"皱着眉头，伸手推门"}
{"time": 1753549871, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1138254407", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "门传来微微的阻力，缓缓打开，并且合页处因为生锈传来嘎吱嘎吱的响声，在安静的环境里清晰可辩。"}
{"time": 1753549916, "type": "recv", "message_id": "319225747", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "松了口气，探头打量门后的状况"}
{"time": 1753549995, "type": "recv", "message_id": "622398431", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（妈的我隔壁宿舍打个喷嚏吓了我一下）"}
{"time": 1753550104, "type": "recv", "message_id": "509748932", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(太逼真了？)"}
{"time": 1753550107, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1698302594", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "门后是旧校舍的连廊，木质地板，有些地方腐蚀凹陷下去了。连廊的右边没有墙壁，正对着旧校舍的天井，天井再看过去即是刚才看到的大门。"}
{"time": 1753550167, "type": "recv", "message_id": "781106434", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "思考一下刚刚看到的有反光的房间大致的位置，在门口撒点盐，拿着御币走进去"}
{"time": 1753550261, "type": "recv", "message_id": "937475460", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=613B20A15EFEC7975B690938EE9CC257.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhSpmx0EHqrk5zUOucsKROwReG5HFRjKfyD_Cijovufig9uOAzIEcHJvZFCAvaMBWhAMtMNV_DBVOegEM6QiRp8PegLqxg&amp;rkey=CAQSMJXU94TyeIqg5rNGUnTI_HCKugf1KSQexHBkupoc-FSPmM_4NoqBBT-t6IAECdJdmA,file_size=16330]"}
